  "description": "Drop-in ASP.NET Core middleware that improves Core Web Vitals without touching your app code. Adds critical CSS inlining, LCP preload injection, lazy loading, and on-demand WebP/AVIF image transcoding to every HTML response — powered by the C++23 PageSpeed engine via P/Invoke, with zero-copy cache hits. Single-package install with transitive native binaries for linux-x64, linux-arm64, osx-arm64, and win-x64. Commercial license; 14-day trial via the in-app console.",
